==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Demon Gory]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Demon Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Demon Gory]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

